{:role/id :role/deploy-verifier

 ;; Deliberately declared tool-policies rather than capabilities. The
 ;; capabilities that cover these tools also cover their write siblings —
 ;; :cap/event-runtime carries events.dispatch and agents.spawn, :cap/discord
 ;; carries publish and send — and a deploy gate has no business holding them.
 ;; The three probed tools are read-only: semantic_query the corpus data
 ;; plane, events.status the events runtime, discord.list.servers the verifier
 ;; actor's credential resolution.
 :role/tool-policies ["semantic_query" "events.status" "discord.list.servers"]}
